/// M30 HISTORY-046 "T26 comparison: roots green".
/// Source: tests/baseline/
/// t26_product_guide_test.go symbol
/// TestT26AgentComparisonReportConsistent
/// (L150-207) plus t26Report (L132-146).
/// Disposition: consolidate (this row ports
/// TestT26AgentComparisonReportConsistent to
/// ordinary Can functions; the old Go harness stays
/// until the integrator retires it after every
/// linked row, variant, environment and control has
/// accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): the static guard spellings
/// as the green root: the test name, the report
/// shape name, the loader plus root calls, the json
/// file names, every refusal guard, the slot joins,
/// the Stat call, the err guard, the Fatal plus
/// Error calls, and the fatal/error counts.
/// ADAPTATION (recorded, with source lines):
/// test-name pins TestT26AgentComparisonReportConsistent
/// (L150); type-name pins t26Report (L132);
/// loader-call pins loadJSON (L153); root-call pins
/// repoRoot(t) (L151); registry-file pins
/// registry.json (L153); report-file pins the json
/// name (L158); registry-guard pins the reg.Task
/// not-equal T01 spelling (L154); report-guard pins
/// the rep.Task not-equal T26 spelling (L159);
/// trials-guard pins the status/attempts or spelling
/// (L162); significance-guard pins the negated
/// contains spelling (L165); case-trials-guard pins
/// the per-case not-equal spelling (L171);
/// tokens-guard pins the nil spelling (L174);
/// disposition-guard pins the empty spelling (L177);
/// omit-guard pins the negated got spelling (L182);
/// count-guard pins the len not-equal spelling
/// (L186); deferred-guard pins the len is-zero
/// spelling (L189); slot-join pins the full slot
/// join spelling (L193); candidate-join pins the
/// read join spelling (L195); defer-guard pins the
/// negated deferr contains spelling (L200);
/// stat-call pins os.Stat (L204); err-guard pins
/// err != nil (L196); fatal-call pins t.Fatalf
/// (L155); error-call pins t.Error (L172);
/// fatal-count pins int (4) from the four legs
/// (L155/L160/L163/L166); error-count pins int (9)
/// from the nine legs
/// (L172/L175/L178/L183/L187/L190/L197/L201/L205).
/// Facet map (static roots): test-name pins the
/// test (L150); type-name pins t26Report (L132);
/// loader-call pins loadJSON (L153); root-call pins
/// repoRoot(t) (L151); registry-file pins
/// registry.json (L153); report-file pins the json
/// (L158); registry-guard pins not T01 (L154);
/// report-guard pins not T26 (L159); trials-guard
/// pins the or (L162); significance-guard pins the
/// contains (L165); case-trials-guard pins not-run
/// (L171); tokens-guard pins nil (L174);
/// disposition-guard pins empty (L177); omit-guard
/// pins negated got (L182); count-guard pins len
/// (L186); deferred-guard pins zero (L189);
/// slot-join pins the join (L193); candidate-join
/// pins the read (L195); defer-guard pins deferr
/// (L200); stat-call pins os.Stat (L204); err-guard
/// pins err (L196); fatal-call pins t.Fatalf (L155);
/// error-call pins t.Error (L172); fatal-count pins
/// 4; error-count pins 9.
/// The base facts live in
/// history-046-base-semantics.can; the run shape plus
/// diagnostics live in history-046-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none (row lists zero variants; default
/// plus seeded drifts only).
/// Environment: none (no gates; requires []).
/// Logical gates WORK/BUILD/CHILD/CLOCK bind at P23;
/// no live run now. Accept gate P23 is unmet. Timeout
/// 120000ms is the offline default bound (no Go
/// timeout in this row; binds at P23 like the M11
/// no-gate rows).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23
/// unmet).
/// Case history/t26-report-roots checks: test-name,
/// type-name, loader-call, root-call, registry-file,
/// report-file, registry-guard, report-guard,
/// trials-guard, significance-guard, case-trials-guard,
/// tokens-guard, disposition-guard, omit-guard,
